1
00:00:03,890 --> 00:00:05,020
没有一个人在
No one is around.

2
00:00:05,020 --> 00:00:05,720
又是这样
Again.

3
00:00:05,820 --> 00:00:08,440
是我多心了 还是大家最近都在躲着我们
Is it just me or people have been avoiding us lately?

4
00:00:09,160 --> 00:00:11,520
我懂的 养双胞胎太艰辛了
I get it, twins are a ton of work.

5
00:00:11,520 --> 00:00:14,560
但海莉和迪兰非常经常叫我们帮忙
But Haley and Dylan ask us to help out a lot.

6
00:00:14,780 --> 00:00:17,400
或许我们只是因为缺觉而变得神志恍惚了
Maybe we're both just loopy from sleep deprivation.

7
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:20,260
我都不记得我泡了这杯茶
I don't even remember making this cup of tea.

8
00:00:20,535 --> 00:00:22,500
没事 我跟他们一起去慢跑吧
It's fine, I'll just jog with them.

9
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:24,520
你跑步别把自己逼得太狠
Don't push yourself too hard on that run.

10
00:00:24,700 --> 00:00:26,320
拜托 你知道你在跟谁说话吗
Please. You know who you're talking to?

11
00:00:26,820 --> 00:00:28,580
为什么大家总是问我这个问题
Why does everyone always ask me that?

12
00:00:30,820 --> 00:00:32,160
好险啊
That was close.

13
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:33,200
-他们走了吗 -是的
- Are they gone? - Yes.

14
00:00:33,940 --> 00:00:37,120
好了 谁想来当我的魔术助手
Okay, who'd like to help me with a magic trick?

15
00:00:38,360 --> 00:00:39,260
艾丽克斯 好极了
Alex. Great.

16
00:00:39,292 --> 00:00:41,300
你拿着这只鸽子
Now, uh, take this dove --

17
00:00:41,300 --> 00:00:42,280
别激怒它
Try not to rile her up.

18
00:00:42,280 --> 00:00:44,440
它将在我的裤子里待上近一个小时呢
She's about to spend the better part of an hour in my pants.

19
00:00:57,660 --> 00:01:00,820
到目前为止 我们遇到的租客普遍都比较糟心
Until now, we haven't had the best of luck with renters.

20
00:01:01,520 --> 00:01:04,720
你在申请表上说 你是个喜欢猫的人...
So, when you said you were a cat person on your application...

21
00:01:06,446 --> 00:01:08,500
那 只是我手表的反光而已
Oh, oh, that's -- that's just my watch.

22
00:01:08,500 --> 00:01:11,320
但后来布拉德和保罗搬来了 那简直就像
But then Brad and Paul moved in, and it was like

23
00:01:11,320 --> 00:01:13,800
自动送上门的完美夫夫朋友
the perfect friend couple showed up at our front door.

24
00:01:13,800 --> 00:01:17,680
在那个"猫女"之后 你还不想再出租了
And you wanted to stop renting completely after the cat lady.

25
00:01:17,780 --> 00:01:20,900
我无法忍受她每次洗澡时发出的嚎叫
I just -- I couldn't listen to her scream every time she took a bath.

26
00:01:21,460 --> 00:01:23,740
我简直不敢相信我们竟然有这么多共同点
I can't believe how much we have in common.

27
00:01:23,740 --> 00:01:26,320
女儿同龄 你们也都玩橄榄球
Daughters the same age, you both played football.

28
00:01:26,320 --> 00:01:29,160
我的一个前队友现在是洛杉矶闪电队的教练
You know, an ex-teammate of mine is a coach for the Chargers.

29
00:01:29,380 --> 00:01:30,840
他可以让我们上球场
He can get us right on the field.

30
00:01:30,920 --> 00:01:32,379
不过你在选择站位时一定要小心了
You just have to watch where you stand,

31
00:01:32,379 --> 00:01:34,000
因为你可能会处于外接手的下面
'cause you could end up under a wide receiver.

32
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:35,498
好了 别再推销了 我同意了
Okay, stop selling! I'm in!

33
00:01:35,498 --> 00:01:37,753
他们甚至预付了六个月的租金
They even pre-paid for six months.

34
00:01:37,980 --> 00:01:39,580
那意味着他们会一直住到圣诞节
That means they'll be here till Christmas.

35
00:01:39,689 --> 00:01:42,160
我们可以邀请他们一起玩秘密圣诞老人的游戏
We can include them in our Secret Santa!

36
00:01:42,160 --> 00:01:44,020
可以逃过收莉莉礼物也挺不错的
Oh, it would be nice not to get Lily again.

37
00:01:45,580 --> 00:01:47,120
杜克[约翰·韦恩]
The Duke...

38
00:01:47,120 --> 00:01:51,400
变成了尤克[里里]
becomes a uke...

39
00:01:52,966 --> 00:01:55,480
再变成卢克
becomes a Luke.

40
00:01:55,680 --> 00:01:57,340
爸 这太神奇了
Dad, that was amazing!

41
00:01:57,940 --> 00:02:00,420
神奇的是 我竟然认为这种垃圾小把戏
Amazing that I think a hacky parlor trick

42
00:02:00,420 --> 00:02:01,700
有资格出现在南加房宴上
is gonna cut it at SCARB.

43
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:04,340
你没听错 艾丽克斯 南加房宴
You heard me right, Alex -- SCARB!

44
00:02:04,880 --> 00:02:06,860
南加州地区房地产经纪人盛宴
The Southern California Area Realtors' Banquet

45
00:02:06,860 --> 00:02:07,960
对南加州地区的房地产经纪人来说
is the biggest event of the year

46
00:02:07,960 --> 00:02:09,680
是年度最盛大的活动
for Southern California Area Realtors.

47
00:02:09,780 --> 00:02:11,340
其他一些活动 比如南加协宴
The other events -- SCARL,

48
00:02:11,340 --> 00:02:14,198
南加联宴 南加会宴 南加群宴...
SCARD, SCARP, SCARG, SCARF --

49
00:02:14,198 --> 00:02:18,000
也挺好的 但南加房宴 才是业内的顶级盛会
t-they're fine, but SCARB, it's -- it's the show.

50
00:02:18,060 --> 00:02:19,480
我在去年的南加房宴上表演了
I performed at last year's SCARB,

51
00:02:19,480 --> 00:02:21,420
我表现得挺好的
and -- and I did well.

52
00:02:23,220 --> 00:02:23,760
好过头了
Too well.

53
00:02:24,420 --> 00:02:25,160
谢谢大家
Thank you.

54
00:02:25,620 --> 00:02:28,240
等等 还有人要说谢谢吗
Wait, was there someone else who wanted to say thank you?

55
00:02:28,800 --> 00:02:29,880
没错
Oh, that's right.

56
00:02:30,380 --> 00:02:31,900
蓬蓬也想说声谢谢
Puff wanted to say thank you.

57
00:02:33,540 --> 00:02:35,720
非常感谢 谢谢
Thank you so much. Thank you.

58
00:02:36,520 --> 00:02:37,120
难以置信
Unbelievable!

59
00:02:37,560 --> 00:02:39,380
你在水下憋了9分钟
When you were underwater for nine minutes,

60
00:02:39,380 --> 00:02:41,400
我都想亲自砸缸救人了
I almost broke the glass myself!

61
00:02:41,429 --> 00:02:42,920
你明年一定要接着来表演
You have got to come back next year.

62
00:02:42,920 --> 00:02:44,346
我想我可以
Well, I guess I could, uh...

63
00:02:45,360 --> 00:02:49,380
在你身后 支持你这话
...get behind you on that.

64
00:02:51,060 --> 00:02:53,020
我都不知道我是怎么做到的
I don't know how I did that.

65
00:02:53,600 --> 00:02:54,360
去年一整年
For the last year,

66
00:02:54,360 --> 00:02:56,780
我去加州任何房产经纪人酒吧 就没花钱买过酒
I haven't paid for a drink in any Realtor bar in California.

67
00:02:57,060 --> 00:02:58,296
我从未见识过那种奉承
I've never known that kind of adulation.

68
00:02:58,296 --> 00:03:00,940
如果我今晚演砸了 这一切就都没了
If I blow it tonight, it all goes away.

69
00:03:00,940 --> 00:03:03,299
我就成了又一个走进中介酒吧的流浪汉
I'm just another bum walking into Brokers

70
00:03:03,299 --> 00:03:05,760
要自己掏钱买"长托管冰茶"
paying for my own Long Escrow Iced Tea!

71
00:03:05,760 --> 00:03:08,020
爸 我现在很有希望拿到太空总署的这份工作
Dad, I'm on the short list for this NASA job.

72
00:03:08,020 --> 00:03:09,600
我需要填好这些表
I just need to finish these forms,

73
00:03:09,600 --> 00:03:12,380
但我发誓 你刚刚的表演真的很棒
but I -- I swear to you, it really was great.

74
00:03:12,980 --> 00:03:13,840
抱歉
I'm sorry.

75
00:03:14,380 --> 00:03:16,120
我可是个很难取悦的观众
And I am a tough audience.

76
00:03:16,400 --> 00:03:17,260
我是个科学家
I'm a scientist.

77
00:03:17,480 --> 00:03:19,880
我可不会被简单的误导欺骗
It's not like I'm fooled by simple misdirection.

78
00:03:20,320 --> 00:03:21,580
我跟珍妮丝说我21岁了
I told Janice I'm 21.

79
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:23,380
我很确定 如果让她发现
I'm pretty sure she'd break up with me

80
00:03:23,380 --> 00:03:25,000
我还没到法定年龄 肯定会跟我分手
if she found out I wasn't even legal yet.

81
00:03:25,500 --> 00:03:28,260
然后她问我能不能为今晚的晚餐买瓶红酒
Then she asked if I'd buy wine for dinner tonight.

82
00:03:29,060 --> 00:03:30,780
能把手指移开吗
Mind moving your thumb...

83
00:03:30,780 --> 00:03:31,840
亚历桑德拉
Alexandra?

84
00:03:33,060 --> 00:03:34,440
原来二姐的名字全名是这样啊
That's what that's short for?

85
00:03:45,180 --> 00:03:46,917
你愿意带他们去公园 真是太好了
So sweet of you to take them to the park.

86
00:03:46,917 --> 00:03:48,720
不过记得一定要找阴凉处
Just make sure they're someplace shady.

87
00:03:48,720 --> 00:03:49,420
我会的
Will do.

88
00:03:51,240 --> 00:03:53,684
你靠售卖家族祖传辣酱发家致富
It's amazing how well you've been doing

89
00:03:53,684 --> 00:03:55,660
发展得这么好 真是太棒了
selling Aunt Miranda's hot sauce.

90
00:03:55,660 --> 00:03:56,640
我都懒得跟你提
I don't want to tell you

91
00:03:56,640 --> 00:03:59,460
我试图在这边卖那个辣酱亏了多少钱
how much money I have lost trying to sell it over here.

92
00:03:59,500 --> 00:04:01,400
我倒是不介意知道一下具体亏损数额...
I wouldn't mind having an exact figure --

93
00:04:01,400 --> 00:04:04,280
我简直不敢相信你们已经订婚了
I can't believe that you guys are already engaged!

94
00:04:04,500 --> 00:04:05,756
你们是在哪里认识的
Where did you guys meet?

95
00:04:05,756 --> 00:04:07,920
在我卖画的那条街上
On the street where I sell my artwork.

96
00:04:07,920 --> 00:04:09,760
有一天 她让我给她画像
One day, she let me paint her.

97
00:04:09,920 --> 00:04:10,680
她成了我的灵感女神
She became my muse.

98
00:04:10,960 --> 00:04:12,540
我真是太为你开心了 桑娅
I am so happy for you, Sonia.

99
00:04:12,840 --> 00:04:15,320
你终于找到你值得拥有的真爱了
Finally, you found the love that you deserve.

100
00:04:16,083 --> 00:04:19,240
我很高兴看到你这么支持桑娅...
It's great seeing you being supportive of Sonia for --

101
00:04:19,240 --> 00:04:19,940
她是个白痴
She's an idiot.

102
00:04:20,160 --> 00:04:21,440
那男的明显是个傍大款的
He's obviously a gold digger,

103
00:04:21,440 --> 00:04:22,840
我要向她证明这点
and I'm going to prove it to her.

104
00:04:23,100 --> 00:04:24,520
你怎么知道他是个傍大款的
How do you know he's a gold digger?

105
00:04:24,620 --> 00:04:27,000
他是个穷困潦倒的画家 她是个富婆
He's a starving artist, she has money.

106
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:29,500
你真觉得像他那么年轻又好看的人
Do you really think that someone young and beautiful like that

107
00:04:29,500 --> 00:04:32,180
会爱上一个年纪大很多的有钱人吗
is gonna fall in love with a rich, older person?

108
00:04:32,220 --> 00:04:33,200
永远没可能的
Never happens.

109
00:04:33,740 --> 00:04:36,280
我听出我这话里的意思了 我们之间没事
I hear what I'm saying, and we're fine.

110
00:04:39,077 --> 00:04:40,900
等谢丽尔·麦克雷进来时
When Sheryl McCray comes in,

111
00:04:40,900 --> 00:04:43,400
用这张卡给她的咖啡买单
pay for her coffee with this.

112
00:04:44,332 --> 00:04:47,680
谢丽尔·麦克雷 强大房地产开发商
Sheryl McCray, Powerhouse real-estate developer.

113
00:04:47,680 --> 00:04:50,120
我多年来一直希望他们把衣柜业务交给我们来做
I've been trying to land her closet business for years,

114
00:04:50,120 --> 00:04:52,100
但无论如何就是约不上她
but it's impossible to get a meeting.

115
00:04:52,600 --> 00:04:54,020
但是 这篇文章写了
This article, though,

116
00:04:54,020 --> 00:04:57,260
她每周六早上十点买拿铁的地点
says where she buys a latte every Saturday at 10:00.

117
00:04:57,460 --> 00:05:00,721
今天 我要给她买杯拿铁
Today, I'm gonna buy that latte, we'll get to talking,

118
00:05:00,721 --> 00:05:01,880
然后我们就开始聊天 不知不觉
and before you know it,

119
00:05:01,880 --> 00:05:04,360
她就会"拿铁"衣柜的订单到我手里
she'll be buying a latte closets.

120
00:05:04,858 --> 00:05:06,017
谢丽尔·麦克雷吗
Sheryl McCray?

121
00:05:06,059 --> 00:05:08,191
马修·康 来自康氏橱柜
Matthew Kang, Kang Cabinets.

122
00:05:08,191 --> 00:05:09,620
能给我两分钟的时间坐下来...
Would you have just two minutes to, uh, sit dow--

123
00:05:09,620 --> 00:05:10,300
你有没有搞错
Are you serious?

124
00:05:11,520 --> 00:05:13,240
我不会和你这种
I'm not gonna do business with someone

125
00:05:13,240 --> 00:05:15,060
居然打断我单独和我孩子
who interrupts me in a coffee shop

126
00:05:15,060 --> 00:05:17,300
以及孩子的保姆在咖啡店
while I'm trying to enjoy a few precious moments

127
00:05:17,300 --> 00:05:19,735
享受美好时光的人做生意
of alone time with my child. And her nanny.

128
00:05:19,735 --> 00:05:21,348
我觉得她尿湿了
I think she's wet.

129
00:05:22,140 --> 00:05:23,540
计划有变吗 土豪
Change of plans, big spender?

130
00:05:25,718 --> 00:05:28,540
真的吗 紧急情况吗
Ohh! Really? An emergency?

131
00:05:28,540 --> 00:05:29,280
我想我能
Well, I guess I could --

132
00:05:29,280 --> 00:05:31,320
放松 他们不需要帮忙带孩子
Relax. They don't need help with the babies.

133
00:05:31,320 --> 00:05:32,020
卢克带着呢
Luke has them.

134
00:05:32,160 --> 00:05:33,079
谢天谢地
Oh, thank God.

135
00:05:33,079 --> 00:05:35,800
赶紧把这破杂志丢一边
Ugh. Let's get rid of this bad reminder, huh?

136
00:05:35,800 --> 00:05:36,760
我认识她
Oh, I know that lady.

137
00:05:37,040 --> 00:05:37,755
什么 怎么认识的
What? How?

138
00:05:37,755 --> 00:05:39,780
在瑜伽房的"妈妈和我"课上认识的
Oh, Mommy and Me class at my yoga place,

139
00:05:39,780 --> 00:05:40,760
她每周都在那
she's there every week.

140
00:05:40,900 --> 00:05:42,972
正好 再过半个小时就要开始了
Oh, in fact, it's starting in half an hour.

141
00:05:42,972 --> 00:05:46,460
我该带着孩子过去上课啦
Think I'm gonna grab the kids and go do my thang.

142
00:05:46,460 --> 00:05:46,880
你知道吗
You know what?

143
00:05:46,900 --> 00:05:48,760
我都没好好和这俩小家伙待过呢
I haven't spent any time with those little ragamuffins.

144
00:05:48,760 --> 00:05:49,856
让我带他们去吧
Why don't you let me take 'em?

145
00:05:49,856 --> 00:05:52,200
-但我有点想 -接受帮助吧
- But I kind of wanted to take-- - Oh, take the help!

146
00:05:52,200 --> 00:05:54,180
别逞英雄啦 超级妈妈
Don't be a hero, super mom, huh?

147
00:05:56,480 --> 00:05:58,860
是我觉得 还是你们也觉得你妈有点怪
Is it me, or is your mom acting weird?

148
00:05:59,140 --> 00:06:00,432
不不
No. No!

149
00:06:00,432 --> 00:06:02,040
不要 你这个
Don't you ev--

150
00:06:02,040 --> 00:06:03,500
听到咒语再出来
Your cue is "Cadabra"!

151
00:06:09,100 --> 00:06:10,900
我们做了甘蓝冰沙 分一些给你们
We made kale smoothies. We wanted to share.

152
00:06:11,020 --> 00:06:11,940
谢谢
Thank you.

153
00:06:12,832 --> 00:06:15,060
不好意思 我们好像打扰你们了
Oh, no! We're intruding.

154
00:06:15,060 --> 00:06:16,460
你们在举办薄饼早午餐会呢
You're throwing a big pancake brunch.

155
00:06:16,740 --> 00:06:17,740
其他人呢
Where is everyone?

156
00:06:18,160 --> 00:06:19,900
这只是我们自己吃的
Uh, this is just for us.

157
00:06:21,067 --> 00:06:23,780
-这是什么 -学校的艺术项目
- What's this? - Art project for school.

158
00:06:23,780 --> 00:06:25,240
我就随便从垃圾里找了个东西
I just grabbed something out of the trash

159
00:06:25,240 --> 00:06:26,800
然后粘了点闪光胶水
and threw glitter glue on it.

160
00:06:27,040 --> 00:06:27,750
就得了70
Got a 70.

161
00:06:27,750 --> 00:06:29,560
她知道总分是100吧
She knows that's out of 100, right?

162
00:06:29,560 --> 00:06:31,660
薇拉正在处于艺术发现阶段
Vera went through a Found Art phase.

163
00:06:31,880 --> 00:06:32,920
这是
This is, um...

164
00:06:32,920 --> 00:06:34,540
这是她用塑料做的
This is the Michelangelo's David

165
00:06:34,540 --> 00:06:36,240
米开朗基罗的大卫像
that she made out of plastic.

166
00:06:36,540 --> 00:06:37,560
再生塑料
Recycled plastic.

167
00:06:37,940 --> 00:06:40,640
我们只有一个星球 我们要保护它
We only get one planet, let's take care of it.

168
00:06:41,280 --> 00:06:43,180
看来有人没听过月球
Guess someone's never heard of the moon.

169
00:06:43,880 --> 00:06:46,180
说起来艺术 你们太幸运了
Oh, hey, speaking of art, you're so lucky

170
00:06:46,180 --> 00:06:47,939
住这里离博物馆那么近
to live right around the corner from the museum.

171
00:06:47,939 --> 00:06:50,287
后印象派展览里谁是你们最喜欢的艺术家
Who was your favorite artist in the postimpressionist show?

172
00:06:51,653 --> 00:06:52,540
非要我说的话
I mean, gun to my head?

173
00:06:52,540 --> 00:06:53,240
我会说
I would say...

174
00:06:53,240 --> 00:06:55,140
高更[再去]吗
Gauguin, perhaps?

175
00:06:55,680 --> 00:06:57,380
去展览吗 当然 想都不用想
To the exhibit? Yes. In a heartbeat.

176
00:06:57,620 --> 00:06:59,500
事实上我想今天过去
Uh, you know, actually, I'm thinking about going today.

177
00:06:59,560 --> 00:07:00,540
你们要一起吗
Would you guys care to join?

178
00:07:01,040 --> 00:07:02,180
我很想去
Oh, I'd love to,

179
00:07:02,180 --> 00:07:05,140
但我答应这位要一起峡谷徒步
but I promised this one we'd go on a canyon hike.

180
00:07:05,220 --> 00:07:06,460
他曾经是内衣模特
Once an underwear model...

181
00:07:06,620 --> 00:07:08,180
为了赚医学院的学费
A couple International Male covers

182
00:07:08,180 --> 00:07:09,620
上过几次《国际男性》的封面而已
to pay for medical school,

183
00:07:09,620 --> 00:07:11,800
他一直提
he'll never let me forget it!

184
00:07:11,860 --> 00:07:12,980
好了 我们该走了
Okay, we should go.

185
00:07:13,280 --> 00:07:14,960
或者你们想一起去徒步吗
Oh! Unless, did you want to join for the hike?

186
00:07:15,180 --> 00:07:18,400
不好意思 我今天下午
Oh, I'm sorry, I'm -- I'm running the Santa Monica stairs

187
00:07:18,400 --> 00:07:19,465
要去爬圣塔莫尼卡台阶 所以
this afternoon, so...

188
00:07:19,465 --> 00:07:20,260
今天是周六
Oh. It's Saturday.

189
00:07:20,260 --> 00:07:21,700
大家伙儿看不到我会着急的
If they don't see me there, they get worried.

190
00:07:22,260 --> 00:07:23,740
谢谢你们的冰沙
And thank you for the yummies.

191
00:07:24,400 --> 00:07:26,260
真的好好喝
They sure are!

192
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:27,440
一点也不好吃
Oh, no.

193
00:07:27,880 --> 00:07:30,920
我都不知道你喜欢博物馆呢
So, um, I didn't know you were a museum lover.

194
00:07:31,060 --> 00:07:33,220
在咱俩开始约会之前
Oh, well, yeah, before you and I started dating,

195
00:07:33,220 --> 00:07:34,639
我总是去博物馆
I used to go to the museum all the time.

196
00:07:34,639 --> 00:07:37,000
当然 我不是在怪你
I'm not blaming you, of course.

197
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:38,840
你知道好莱坞名人蜡像博物馆
You know that the Hollywood Wax Museum

198
00:07:38,840 --> 00:07:39,698
不是真正的...
isn't an actual --

199
00:07:39,698 --> 00:07:40,680
你呢 猛男洛奇
Okay, what about you, Rocky?

200
00:07:40,680 --> 00:07:43,160
你拿毛巾上楼都气喘吁吁
You get winded taking towels upstairs.

201
00:07:43,220 --> 00:07:45,960
是因为遇到你之后 不是怪你哦
Well, that's because after we met -- not blaming you --

202
00:07:45,960 --> 00:07:47,980
我有点 我逐渐不爬了
um, I sort of -- I tapered off a little bit.

203
00:07:48,700 --> 00:07:49,820
为了专注于咱俩的感情
To focus on the relationship.

204
00:07:49,820 --> 00:07:52,000
但这样很好啊
But this is good.

205
00:07:52,120 --> 00:07:53,800
我们重回原来的状态
Yeah. Us getting back to our roots.

206
00:07:53,800 --> 00:07:55,087
享受博物馆
You know, enjoy the museum.

207
00:07:55,087 --> 00:07:56,333
-享受你的跑步 -我会的
- Yeah, enjoy your run. - I will.

208
00:07:56,820 --> 00:07:58,739
或许你还没...
You haven't, by chance --

209
00:07:58,739 --> 00:07:59,595
他们还在盒子里
They're still in the box.

210
00:07:59,595 --> 00:08:01,137
-橱柜后面吗 -是的
- Back of the closet? - Uh-huh.

211
00:08:02,800 --> 00:08:04,380
你怎么从来没让我玩过那个东西
How come you never let me play with that thing?

212
00:08:04,424 --> 00:08:07,980
这东西可在三个航空展上获过奖 曼尼
This "thing" medaled in three different Air Expos, Manny.

213
00:08:07,980 --> 00:08:08,840
它可不是玩具
It's not a toy.

214
00:08:09,080 --> 00:08:10,360
看这个
Hey, look at this.

215
00:08:10,360 --> 00:08:12,420
这是桑娅的未婚夫 对吧
That's Sonia's fiance, right?

216
00:08:12,480 --> 00:08:14,480
据说他来自哥伦比亚最富有的家族
It says he's from one of the richest families in Colombia.

217
00:08:14,520 --> 00:08:15,780
我知道那家伙不错的
I knew the guy was all right.

218
00:08:16,020 --> 00:08:18,080
我明白了 有钱就是不错
Oh, I see. Being rich makes you "all right."

219
00:08:18,140 --> 00:08:19,020
我不是这个意思
That's not what I meant.

220
00:08:19,020 --> 00:08:20,840
你妈以为他可能是来傍大款的
Your mom thought he might be a gold digger.

221
00:08:20,840 --> 00:08:22,820
而且不像你 我可是成长于工薪阶级
And by the way, unlike you, I grew up working-class.

222
00:08:23,680 --> 00:08:25,760
得了 这个家里唯一的蓝领[项圈]
Oh, please. The only blue collar in this house

223
00:08:25,760 --> 00:08:28,120
就是你纯种法国斗牛犬脖子上的亮晶晶项圈
is the bedazzled one on your purebred French bulldog.

224
00:08:28,160 --> 00:08:29,840
她最近挺抑郁的
She was going through a depressed period.

225
00:08:29,860 --> 00:08:32,680
家里最不开心的孩子 影响着父母开心的上限
You're only as happy as your least happy child, Manny.

226
00:08:32,780 --> 00:08:34,040
我只是说 我从没见过
I'm just saying, I've never seen you

227
00:08:34,040 --> 00:08:35,800
你对没钱的人感兴趣
show much interest in someone who didn't have money.

228
00:08:35,860 --> 00:08:36,620
胡说
That's ridiculous.

229
00:08:36,960 --> 00:08:38,840
老兄 过来歇歇吧
Hey, buddy! Come on, take a load off.

230
00:08:38,840 --> 00:08:41,020
-一起喝一杯 -谢谢你先生
- Have a drink with us. - Oh, thank you, sir.

231
00:08:41,080 --> 00:08:43,720
我知道辛苦工作一天是什么感觉
I know what it's like to put in a hard day's work.

232
00:08:43,960 --> 00:08:45,040
杰·普里契特 顺便一提
Jay Pritchett, by the way.

233
00:08:45,140 --> 00:08:46,540
知道 我们见过很多次了
Yes, we've met many times.

234
00:08:47,180 --> 00:08:48,900
记得吗 几年前 我借给你打车钱
Remember, a couple years ago, I loaned you money for a cab?

235
00:08:48,900 --> 00:08:50,510
对啊
Oh, yeah, right.

236
00:08:52,001 --> 00:08:52,900
妈妈
Ay, Mama.

237
00:08:52,900 --> 00:08:54,840
她不是为了我们的钱
She's not after our money.

238
00:08:55,480 --> 00:08:56,600
我怎么知道
How do I know?

239
00:08:56,760 --> 00:08:58,180
她有钱 很有钱
She has money! Lots of it.

240
00:08:58,180 --> 00:08:59,660
我要娶这个女人
And I'm marrying this woman.

241
00:09:00,040 --> 00:09:02,020
我们下周婚礼见
I'll see you for the wedding next week.

242
00:09:02,881 --> 00:09:04,427
下周
Ay, next week?

243
00:09:04,480 --> 00:09:05,440
真快啊
That's very quick.

244
00:09:05,780 --> 00:09:08,080
我不想给桑娅改变想法的机会
I don't want to give Sonia a chance to change her mind.

245
00:09:08,300 --> 00:09:09,520
我肯定你不想
I'm sure you don't.

246
00:09:10,300 --> 00:09:12,420
你不能娶桑娅
You can't marry my sister.

247
00:09:12,740 --> 00:09:13,120
为什么
Why?

248
00:09:13,520 --> 00:09:13,800
英文两字
Two words.

249
00:09:14,800 --> 00:09:16,240
带连字符也可以算一个字
Maybe one, with a hyphen.

250
00:09:16,480 --> 00:09:17,280
傍大款
Gold digger.

251
00:09:17,720 --> 00:09:19,260
我很讨厌看到人
I've always hated to see people

252
00:09:19,260 --> 00:09:21,200
以这种方式占别人便宜
take advantage of others in that way.

253
00:09:21,580 --> 00:09:23,140
我不能让这种事发生在我家
I can't let that happen here.

254
00:09:23,200 --> 00:09:25,040
但桑娅不是很有钱吗
But doesn't your sister have a lot of money?

255
00:09:25,260 --> 00:09:27,560
如果她没钱 你会那么快就和她结婚吗
Would you be that quick to marry her if she didn't?

256
00:09:30,260 --> 00:09:31,600
你有看到涅斯托尔吗
Hey, have you seen Nestor?

257
00:09:31,960 --> 00:09:33,400
我把他送走了
I sent him off.

258
00:09:33,620 --> 00:09:35,920
今天没人会拿别人的钱了
Nobody's taking anyone's money today.

259
00:09:36,120 --> 00:09:37,540
我不需要他给我很多钱
Oh, I didn't need that much from him.

260
00:09:37,540 --> 00:09:39,700
我只需要重新拍摄我的电影结尾
I just need to reshoot the end of my thesis film.

261
00:09:39,920 --> 00:09:42,360
特效很差 布拉格一看就是假的
The special effects are weak, and Prague was clearly faked.

262
00:09:42,600 --> 00:09:44,140
你到底在说什么
What the hell are you talking about?

263
00:09:44,260 --> 00:09:46,060
涅斯托尔 他家很有钱
Nestor. His family's loaded.

264
00:09:46,300 --> 00:09:47,400
我查了他的资料
I looked him up.

265
00:09:48,558 --> 00:09:49,961
他是贝瑞勒兹家族的吗
He's a Berellez?

266
00:09:50,300 --> 00:09:52,760
他们手里有一支足球队 十二家酒店
They own a soccer team, 12 hotels,

267
00:09:52,760 --> 00:09:53,880
还有五个法官
and five judges!

268
00:09:56,000 --> 00:09:56,920
真的吗
Oh, really?

269
00:09:57,040 --> 00:10:00,080
我不在乎你是否想买一万个壁橱
Well, I don't care if you want to buy 10,000 closets.

270
00:10:00,300 --> 00:10:01,158
我没上班
I'm not at work.

271
00:10:01,158 --> 00:10:04,377
我想和我的孩子... 们共处
I am trying to bond with my child...ren.

272
00:10:04,860 --> 00:10:05,380
拜拜
Bye.

273
00:10:06,180 --> 00:10:06,660
你好
Hi.

274
00:10:06,820 --> 00:10:09,080
实在抱歉 只是
So sorry about that. It's just -- Ugh.

275
00:10:09,080 --> 00:10:11,120
总是有人要给我推销产品
People are constantly trying to sell me,

276
00:10:11,120 --> 00:10:14,180
但真的不是所有时刻都合适谈生意 你懂吗
and it is not always appropriate, you know?

277
00:10:14,600 --> 00:10:15,460
完全理解
I hear that.

278
00:10:16,100 --> 00:10:17,376
妈妈们 妈妈们
Mommies, mommies.

279
00:10:17,376 --> 00:10:18,556
盖理
Gary.

280
00:10:19,340 --> 00:10:20,800
让我们从臀部拉伸开始
Let's start with a deep hip stretch.

281
00:10:22,480 --> 00:10:24,920
我觉得这门课够难了 你怎么还能带双胞胎上
I find this class hard enough. How do you do it with twins?

282
00:10:25,520 --> 00:10:27,603
在难也没有处理工作上
Well, uh, it's nothing compared to the babies

283
00:10:27,603 --> 00:10:29,160
那些巨婴还难啊
I got to juggle at the office, huh?

284
00:10:29,320 --> 00:10:30,640
我明白那种感觉
I know that feeling.

285
00:10:30,820 --> 00:10:33,320
上下运动 更深一些
Now up and down, a little deeper.

286
00:10:33,332 --> 00:10:36,380
有个欢迎婴儿的小吃店
You know, there's a baby-friendly tapas place

287
00:10:36,380 --> 00:10:39,440
阿迪克斯和我一会去 你们愿意可以一起来
Atticus and I go to after, if you ladies are up for it.

288
00:10:40,000 --> 00:10:41,580
我觉得现在不是交朋友的时刻 盖里
I don't think it's time to bond, Gary,

289
00:10:41,580 --> 00:10:43,520
而且我挺确定你是告了这里才让你进来的
and I'm pretty sure you had to sue to get in here.

290
00:10:43,700 --> 00:10:44,980
他有 向上
He did. And up.

291
00:10:44,980 --> 00:10:46,320
我们不得不和解 向下
We had to settle. And down.

292
00:10:47,660 --> 00:10:49,360
你们做什么样的衣橱
So, what kind of closets do you make?

293
00:10:49,600 --> 00:10:50,880
因为我其实需要
Because I actually need --

294
00:10:50,880 --> 00:10:52,600
我们下课再说可以吗
You know what? Would it be okay if we did this after class?

295
00:10:52,900 --> 00:10:55,276
只是 我平常没时间和他们在一起
It's just, I get no time with them.

296
00:10:55,276 --> 00:10:57,129
当然 当然
Of course, of course.

297
00:11:03,320 --> 00:11:04,798
爬台阶怎么样了
Oh. Hey. How were the steps?

298
00:11:04,798 --> 00:11:07,059
很好 很辛苦
Uh...so -- so great. So tough.

299
00:11:07,059 --> 00:11:08,380
喜欢燃烧卡路里的感觉
Uh, love the burn.

300
00:11:08,380 --> 00:11:09,781
帽子怎么回事 我都看不到你的眼睛了
What's up with the hat? I can barely see your eyes.

301
00:11:09,781 --> 00:11:10,903
还是一样的眼眸
Uh, same old eyes.

302
00:11:10,903 --> 00:11:12,243
我只是要去
I'm just gonna go ahead and, um --

303
00:11:13,100 --> 00:11:15,740
为什么你的额头上有电影里排球的标志
Why is there a Wilson logo on your forehead?

304
00:11:15,920 --> 00:11:16,860
我不知道 肯定是帽子上的
I don't know. Must be the hat.

305
00:11:17,380 --> 00:11:18,320
没人会买账的
Nobody's buying it.

306
00:11:18,320 --> 00:11:20,099
直接跳到告诉我们真相的部分吧
Just skip to the part where you tell us the truth.

307
00:11:20,099 --> 00:11:23,420
行吧 我没爬楼梯
Fine. I-I never made it to the stairs, okay?

308
00:11:23,420 --> 00:11:25,000
我分心了
I got distracted.

309
00:11:34,480 --> 00:11:35,920
我是骗子 开心了吗
I'm a fraud. Happy?

310
00:11:36,260 --> 00:11:37,680
我甚至都没去楼梯那儿
I never even made it to the stairs.

311
00:11:37,840 --> 00:11:39,280
甚至都不知道在哪里
Don't even know where they are.

312
00:11:39,340 --> 00:11:40,500
我不能说我
You know, I can't say I'm --

313
00:11:40,500 --> 00:11:42,540
我对你一点都不失望 米奇尔
I'm not a tad bit disappointed in you, Mitchell.

314
00:11:42,640 --> 00:11:44,182
只是独自踏上这段自我提升的旅程
It's just a little lonely going on this journey

315
00:11:44,182 --> 00:11:45,428
我有点孤单
of self-improvement all by my--

316
00:11:45,428 --> 00:11:47,100
-那是什么 -什么
- What is that? - Hmm? What?

317
00:11:47,100 --> 00:11:49,780
你从博物馆哪里弄到这个的
What -- What part of the museum did you get this from?

318
00:11:50,196 --> 00:11:51,620
很显然
Uh, well, apparen--

319
00:11:51,620 --> 00:11:52,640
很显然 你不熟悉
obviously, you're not...

320
00:11:52,962 --> 00:11:55,480
马蒂斯的羽毛时期
familiar with Matisse's feather...period.

321
00:11:55,480 --> 00:11:58,060
你是不是在博物馆对面弄到的
Did you maybe get this across the street from the museum?

322
00:11:58,076 --> 00:11:59,620
不是
Hmm? No.

323
00:11:59,620 --> 00:12:02,620
如果是的话 你会有一个与众不同
'Cause if you had, you'd have a distinctive and sparkly...

324
00:12:02,620 --> 00:12:03,780
闪闪发光手背印章
hand stamp!

325
00:12:04,246 --> 00:12:05,540
我只需要一张票
I-I just need one ticket.

326
00:12:05,540 --> 00:12:06,780
大家快点
Oh, my God, you guys, let's hurry!

327
00:12:07,460 --> 00:12:07,920
快点去哪里
Hurrying where?

328
00:12:07,920 --> 00:12:09,623
有个回顾展
Uh, there's a retrospective --

329
00:12:09,623 --> 00:12:12,436
"七十年代的雪儿: 吉普赛人 流浪汉和小偷
"Cher in the '70s: Gypsies, Tramps and Thieves."

330
00:12:13,240 --> 00:12:14,880
你丢下我自己去了
You went without me?

331
00:12:14,940 --> 00:12:16,380
我们一直怎么说的
What do we always say?

332
00:12:16,491 --> 00:12:19,003
每次看雪儿的经历都应该是
Every Cher experience should be

333
00:12:19,003 --> 00:12:21,311
-共同的经历 -共同的经历
- a shared experience. - Shared experience.

334
00:12:21,546 --> 00:12:22,883
我很抱歉 米奇尔
I'm -- I'm sorry, Mitchell.

335
00:12:23,200 --> 00:12:24,620
如果我能让时光倒流
If I could turn back time --

336
00:12:26,740 --> 00:12:27,903
敲敲
Knock knock!

337
00:12:27,903 --> 00:12:28,540
把羽毛给我
Give -- Give me the feather.

338
00:12:28,540 --> 00:12:29,560
不 把羽毛放在你的帽子里
No, put the feather in your cap.

339
00:12:30,160 --> 00:12:31,760
只是来看看 博物馆怎么样
Hey, just checking in. How was the museum?

340
00:12:32,380 --> 00:12:33,540
非常好 请坐
Oh, so great. Sit down!

341
00:12:33,700 --> 00:12:35,780
小卡本来正想告诉我们
Cam was actually about to tell us

342
00:12:35,780 --> 00:12:37,480
他对毕加索的了解
what he learned about Picasso.

343
00:12:37,680 --> 00:12:39,320
我对他知之甚少
Oh, I know so little about him.

344
00:12:39,330 --> 00:12:43,555
原来 他是出生在
Well, it -- it turns out he was born, um...

345
00:12:43,846 --> 00:12:47,120
巡回表演的马车上
in the wagon of a -- of a traveling...show.

346
00:12:47,120 --> 00:12:48,622
他的妈妈 真可怜
His mother, poor thing,

347
00:12:48,622 --> 00:12:51,100
她被迫为大家跳舞
she was forced to dance for all --

348
00:12:51,100 --> 00:12:52,640
你想让我教你打桥牌吗
You want me to teach you how to play bridge?

349
00:12:53,400 --> 00:12:54,660
-当然 -我需要一个新玩伴
- Sure. - I need a new partner.

350
00:12:54,807 --> 00:12:56,767
我和电脑玩总是赢
I keep beating the computer.

351
00:12:57,020 --> 00:12:58,360
我们想邀请你们
Listen, we want to invite you guys

352
00:12:58,360 --> 00:12:59,539
来参加今晚的晚餐聚会
to a dinner party tonight.

353
00:12:59,539 --> 00:13:01,480
你们会很喜欢赞德和马特奥的
Yeah, you guys are gonna love Xander and Mateo.

354
00:13:01,480 --> 00:13:03,620
他们刚在莫桑比克跑完超级马拉松
They just finished an ultramarathon in Mozambique,

355
00:13:03,620 --> 00:13:04,500
他们也在那办讲座
where they're lecturing.

356
00:13:04,680 --> 00:13:05,840
为了暖身开胃
And to build up an appetite,

357
00:13:05,840 --> 00:13:07,521
我们玩短跑猜谜
we play sprinting charades.

358
00:13:07,521 --> 00:13:10,000
还有一个搞笑版本的明星游戏
Yeah, and, uh, this silly version of Celebrity

359
00:13:10,000 --> 00:13:12,280
只用狄更斯小说中的角色
using only characters from Dickens.

360
00:13:13,260 --> 00:13:14,059
听起来真有趣
That sounds so fun.

361
00:13:14,059 --> 00:13:15,100
我们失陪一下
We'll be-We'll be right back.

362
00:13:15,100 --> 00:13:17,700
我们正在用大浅盘把芹菜摆成扇形
We were just fanning out some celery on a platter.

363
00:13:20,520 --> 00:13:21,580
我想让他们走人
Okay, I want them gone.

364
00:13:21,720 --> 00:13:23,320
哪怕你是指杀死他们 我也同意
Even if you mean kill them, I'm in.

365
00:13:23,420 --> 00:13:24,320
我们该怎么办
I mean, what are we supposed to do?

366
00:13:24,320 --> 00:13:26,299
像胡娇脸颊填充物掉下来后那样
Spend the next six months with our drapes closed,

367
00:13:26,299 --> 00:13:28,880
羞得整整六个月都不拉开窗帘吗
like Pepper after one of his cheek implants fell?

368
00:13:28,880 --> 00:13:29,960
他那歪脸还真是毕加索画风
Speaking of Picasso.

369
00:13:30,380 --> 00:13:32,420
我们怎么才能脱身
How are we supposed to get out of this?

370
00:13:32,720 --> 00:13:33,440
搬到西边去
Move out west.

371
00:13:33,787 --> 00:13:36,280
那些小镇就是为了人间蒸发用的
That's what those towns are for -- disappearin'.

372
00:13:36,280 --> 00:13:38,180
咱家离海边就一千六百米 哪来的小镇
We live a mile from the ocean. What town?

373
00:13:38,640 --> 00:13:39,793
我脑子有病吗
What's wrong with me?

374
00:13:39,793 --> 00:13:42,401
我太蠢了
I am so stupid!

375
00:13:42,440 --> 00:13:43,380
亲爱的 怎么了
Sweetie, what is it?

376
00:13:43,680 --> 00:13:46,180
她赢了我 这还是她第一次玩
She beat me, and she never even played before!

377
00:13:47,420 --> 00:13:49,680
我真是个废物
I'm such a loser!

378
00:13:52,080 --> 00:13:54,140
她还好吗
Is she okay, or...?

379
00:13:54,500 --> 00:13:55,300
薇拉总是这样
Vera has this thing

380
00:13:55,300 --> 00:13:57,420
不能每件事都做到完美她就抓狂
where she needs to be perfect all the time.

381
00:13:57,420 --> 00:13:59,640
我们搬到这个社区的唯一原因
You know, the only reason we moved to this neighborhood

382
00:13:59,640 --> 00:14:00,760
就是住在这里
was so we could be closer

383
00:14:00,760 --> 00:14:03,220
离她被录取的精英学校更近
to this accelerated school she got into.

384
00:14:03,700 --> 00:14:05,600
或许我们该重新考虑这个决定
Maybe we need to reconsider the move?

385
00:14:06,220 --> 00:14:08,320
当然 我们还是会付这六个月的钱
Naturally, we'll pay for all six months.

386
00:14:08,320 --> 00:14:09,140
好的
Yes.

387
00:14:09,340 --> 00:14:10,280
我们该去和她聊聊
We should go talk to her.

388
00:14:10,400 --> 00:14:11,320
抱歉 大伙
I'm sorry, guys.

389
00:14:11,320 --> 00:14:13,300
我本来很期待一起吃芹菜的
I was looking forward to that celery.

390
00:14:13,460 --> 00:14:16,300
我今天就想吃那些高热量的
I could really use a cheat day.

391
00:14:16,570 --> 00:14:17,701
薇拉
Vera?!

392
00:14:18,120 --> 00:14:19,140
莉莉 你怎么
Lily, how --

393
00:14:19,460 --> 00:14:21,480
我把镜子放在那就能看到她的牌了
I set up my mirror so I could see her cards.

394
00:14:21,600 --> 00:14:22,820
我别无选择
I had to!

395
00:14:23,020 --> 00:14:25,360
她总让我感到低人一等 我受不了了
I couldn't stand her making me feel bad about myself.

396
00:14:25,560 --> 00:14:26,600
不 我理解
No, no, I get it.

397
00:14:26,600 --> 00:14:29,160
感觉他们好像也不介意让别人感到低人一等
I'm not sure they don't enjoy making people feel inferior.

398
00:14:29,400 --> 00:14:31,080
你们俩就永远不会让人感到低人一等
Which is something you guys could never do.

399
00:14:33,840 --> 00:14:35,320
等等 她是不是说
Wait, did she just say

400
00:14:35,320 --> 00:14:37,060
我们永远不会让人感到低人一等
that we could never make people feel inferior

401
00:14:37,060 --> 00:14:39,180
因为我们自己也不是什么人上人
because we're so inferior ourselves?

402
00:14:39,300 --> 00:14:42,059
但用夸奖的语气说出来 让人不易察觉
But cleverly wrapped in a compliment to avoid detection?

403
00:14:42,059 --> 00:14:43,900
也就是说 完美的基佬损人方式
In other words, the perfect gay zinger?

404
00:14:43,900 --> 00:14:45,180
她或许不能高中毕业
Well, she may not finish high school,

405
00:14:45,180 --> 00:14:46,940
但她在任何托尼奖派对都不会吃亏
but she will hold her own at any Tony party

406
00:14:46,940 --> 00:14:48,805
-这辈子都不会 -没错 不会吃亏
- the rest of her life. - Yeah, she will. Yeah.

407
00:14:49,224 --> 00:14:50,800
听你这么说我很遗憾
I'm really sorry to hear that,

408
00:14:50,800 --> 00:14:53,140
但说实话 要是你妻子离开你
but honestly, if your wife left you

409
00:14:53,140 --> 00:14:54,620
只是因为你错过了她生日
just because you missed her birthday --

410
00:14:54,720 --> 00:14:55,820
是为了开车送你去机场
To drive you to the airport.

411
00:14:55,840 --> 00:14:56,980
我听到了 曼尼 谢谢
I heard him, Manny. Thank you.

412
00:14:57,680 --> 00:14:59,540
或许没有她你会过得更好
you're probably better off without her.

413
00:14:59,840 --> 00:15:00,640
你说得对
You're right.

414
00:15:00,640 --> 00:15:02,640
我只希望今晚去参加儿子的婚礼
I only wish I had something nicer to wear

415
00:15:02,640 --> 00:15:03,780
能有件好衣服穿
to our son's wedding tonight.

416
00:15:04,040 --> 00:15:06,039
要知道 咱俩的尺寸差不多
You know, you and I are about the same size.

417
00:15:06,039 --> 00:15:07,591
不如我把燕尾服借给你
Why don't you borrow my tux?

418
00:15:08,940 --> 00:15:09,340
真的吗
Really?

419
00:15:09,700 --> 00:15:10,380
你一定要穿
I insist.

420
00:15:10,660 --> 00:15:12,500
并且我还想另外给你样东西
In fact, I want to give you something else.

421
00:15:13,060 --> 00:15:13,558
你的飞机
Your plane?

422
00:15:13,558 --> 00:15:15,333
不 我只是在拿钱包
Uh, no, I was reaching for my wallet.

423
00:15:15,333 --> 00:15:18,005
为了还欠着你的出租车钱
You know, to give you that money I s-still owe you for the cab.

424
00:15:18,005 --> 00:15:19,220
自从那次在房顶
I've admired this plane

425
00:15:19,220 --> 00:15:20,920
帮你拿飞机时摔下来 我就一直很喜欢它
ever since I fell off the roof getting it for you.

426
00:15:21,100 --> 00:15:22,434
我好感动 好荣幸
I'm so touched and honored.

427
00:15:22,434 --> 00:15:23,193
其实
Well, actually --

428
00:15:23,193 --> 00:15:24,909
他从房顶摔下来了
He fell off the roof.

429
00:15:29,940 --> 00:15:30,380
好吧
Fine.

430
00:15:30,380 --> 00:15:30,820
尽情玩
Enjoy.

431
00:15:31,380 --> 00:15:33,580
我要叫它萝伯塔
I will name her Roberta.

432
00:15:34,760 --> 00:15:35,820
那飞机是带把的
It's a boy plane.

433
00:15:40,380 --> 00:15:41,936
我好像把粘扣粘错了
I feel like I got the buckles wrong.

434
00:15:41,936 --> 00:15:43,940
你觉得我穿这紧身衣看起来正常吗
Does this straitjacket look right on me?

435
00:15:43,940 --> 00:15:45,180
越来越合你了[精神病人也穿]
More and more.

436
00:15:45,200 --> 00:15:46,060
爸 我爱你
Dad, I love you,

437
00:15:46,060 --> 00:15:48,081
但我没时间再陪你练其他魔术了
but I don't have time for another magic trick.

438
00:15:48,081 --> 00:15:49,220
我找不到我的证件了
I can't find my ID,

439
00:15:49,220 --> 00:15:51,540
申请太空总署的工作需要复印件
and I need a copy of it for this NASA job,

440
00:15:51,540 --> 00:15:53,900
我的申请表必须在五点前寄出去
and my application has to be mailed by 5:00.

441
00:15:53,900 --> 00:15:55,680
真抱歉 要我帮你找吗
I'm sorry. Can I help you look?

442
00:15:56,340 --> 00:15:57,320
太让人绝望了
This is hopeless.

443
00:15:57,820 --> 00:15:59,320
除非有办法能在邮局和车管局
Unless there is some way to jump the line

444
00:15:59,320 --> 00:16:01,580
不用乖乖排长队
at both the post office and the DMV,

445
00:16:01,580 --> 00:16:04,180
而这个时间能顺利开车到这两个地方
and the only way to get to either of them at this hour

446
00:16:04,180 --> 00:16:05,697
只有走拼车专用道
is to drive in the carpool lane.

447
00:16:05,697 --> 00:16:07,504
我们回来了
We're ba-a-ck!

448
00:16:07,920 --> 00:16:10,240
我的天 我好想你们
Oh, my God! I missed you so much!

449
00:16:10,780 --> 00:16:13,360
交给我 你看起来好累
Oh, I got this. You look so tired.

450
00:16:13,360 --> 00:16:14,640
可我睡了一天了
But I've been napping all day.

451
00:16:14,780 --> 00:16:15,300
不客气
You're welcome.

452
00:16:16,715 --> 00:16:18,747
至少让我闻闻他们的头吧
Can I at least smell their heads?!

453
00:16:18,747 --> 00:16:20,207
涅斯托尔
Nestor?

454
00:16:20,207 --> 00:16:22,480
又是我 歌洛莉亚·普里契特
Hi. It's Gloria Pritchett again.

455
00:16:22,480 --> 00:16:23,740
拜托你给我回电话
Please call me back.

456
00:16:24,120 --> 00:16:25,400
我需要解释
I need to explain.

457
00:16:25,400 --> 00:16:27,577
这都是一个大误会
This was all a big mistake.

458
00:16:27,577 --> 00:16:30,412
涅斯托尔 你去哪了 我的爱人
Nestor, where are you, my love?

459
00:16:30,412 --> 00:16:31,438
不
Ay, no.

460
00:16:33,520 --> 00:16:34,080
桑娅
Sonia...

461
00:16:34,080 --> 00:16:36,759
我有个坏消息要告诉你
I have very bad news to tell you.

462
00:16:36,759 --> 00:16:38,341
让我先叫涅斯托尔过来 他是我的精神支柱
Let me get Nestor. He's my rock.

463
00:16:38,341 --> 00:16:39,334
涅斯托尔
Nestor!

464
00:16:39,334 --> 00:16:42,260
我那个独立的妹妹哪去了
Ay, what happened to my independent sister

465
00:16:42,260 --> 00:16:44,820
我是那么崇拜她 因为她不需要男人
that I admired so much because she needed no man?

466
00:16:45,362 --> 00:16:46,620
他在哪里
Where...is he?

467
00:16:46,620 --> 00:16:48,420
我以为他是来傍大款的
Well, I thought he was a gold digger,

468
00:16:48,420 --> 00:16:50,120
所以我把他赶走了
so I chased him out.

469
00:16:50,220 --> 00:16:51,020
你说你干了什么
You did what?!

470
00:16:51,380 --> 00:16:54,760
塞翁失马焉知非福 好歹你的钱还在啊
But the silver lining is that you still have all your money!

471
00:16:55,000 --> 00:16:57,320
什么钱 我有个屁钱啊
What money? I don't have any money!

472
00:16:57,620 --> 00:16:58,300
你这话什么意思
What do you mean?

473
00:16:58,300 --> 00:17:01,240
辣酱生意红火 你不是赚了很多钱吗
The money from the hot-sauce business that you're doing so well.

474
00:17:01,320 --> 00:17:02,460
没有 那全是谎言
No, it was all a lie.

475
00:17:02,460 --> 00:17:04,060
我编来让他不会怀疑我别有居心
I just didn't want him to be suspicious.

476
00:17:04,320 --> 00:17:06,400
看 我戴的是铝制耳环
Look, I'm wearing aluminum earrings!

477
00:17:06,560 --> 00:17:08,040
我的耳朵都要戴发绿了
They're turning my ears green!

478
00:17:08,040 --> 00:17:13,122
我用足足两年才钓上这个有钱帅气的傻逼
It took me two years to land that rich, beautiful moron.

479
00:17:13,122 --> 00:17:18,220
我还能去哪里找到这样的大款啊
Where am I going to get that kind of money?!

480
00:17:18,220 --> 00:17:19,820
哎哟 我被绊倒了
Oh, I tripped!

481
00:17:20,000 --> 00:17:21,160
快来个人帮我找律师
Someone call a lawyer!

482
00:17:21,480 --> 00:17:22,240
你才没被绊倒
You didn't trip.

483
00:17:22,380 --> 00:17:23,554
有的 就是有 你看
Yes, I did! Look!

484
00:17:23,554 --> 00:17:25,445
地上都是湿的
Uh, the floor is all wet.

485
00:17:26,020 --> 00:17:28,900
桑娅 这招在豪华游轮上不好使
Sonia, that didn't work at the Princess Cruise ship,

486
00:17:28,900 --> 00:17:30,340
在我这也不会有用
and it's not going to work here.

487
00:17:31,060 --> 00:17:33,120
每次我想好好过日子
Every time I try to get my life together,

488
00:17:33,120 --> 00:17:34,460
你就总是要搞破坏
you always ruin it for me.

489
00:17:34,760 --> 00:17:36,120
你欠我一个有钱老公
You owe me a rich husband.

490
00:17:36,120 --> 00:17:37,440
我再给你找一个就是了
I'll find you one.

491
00:17:37,680 --> 00:17:40,120
这里多得是又老又有钱的男人
There are plenty of old, rich men around here

492
00:17:40,120 --> 00:17:41,640
你想怎么玩就怎么玩
that would do anything that you say.

493
00:17:41,820 --> 00:17:43,260
某些老男人还有听力呢
Some of them can still hear.

494
00:17:43,794 --> 00:17:45,558
这位是谁啊
Oh. Who's this?

495
00:17:45,780 --> 00:17:47,340
他是...
He's, um...

496
00:17:47,340 --> 00:17:50,400
全城搞树篱[对冲基金]最牛逼的人
He's the best hedge guy in town.

497
00:17:50,760 --> 00:17:53,120
快恭喜他吧 他刚入手一架飞机
Congratulate him. He just got a new plane.

498
00:17:54,293 --> 00:17:56,000
搞对冲的啊
Ohh. A hedge guy.

499
00:17:56,000 --> 00:17:56,560
真有意思
Fascinating.

500
00:17:56,820 --> 00:17:58,940
那你是怎么进入这行的呢
And how did you get started in that business?

501
00:17:59,220 --> 00:18:00,420
我买了剪子[快艇队]
I bought the clippers.

502
00:18:02,080 --> 00:18:04,860
你穿得这么帅是要去哪里吗
And where are you going, dressed so nice?

503
00:18:05,040 --> 00:18:05,594
去参加婚礼
A wedding.

504
00:18:05,594 --> 00:18:07,440
我好喜欢婚礼啊
Ohh, I love weddings.

505
00:18:07,440 --> 00:18:08,320
能有幸请你陪我一同参加吗
Would you like to accompany me?

506
00:18:08,420 --> 00:18:09,953
乐意之至
I would love to!

507
00:18:09,953 --> 00:18:11,700
能坐[带]你的飞机去吗
And can we take your plane?

508
00:18:11,700 --> 00:18:12,460
当然啊 没问题
Yeah, sure.

509
00:18:14,500 --> 00:18:17,040
为什么我们家的园丁穿着你的燕尾服
Why is our gardener wearing your tuxedo?

510
00:18:17,380 --> 00:18:18,960
为什么涅斯托尔不在了
Why is Nestor gone?

511
00:18:19,280 --> 00:18:21,760
让我先去把门锁上
Let me lock the door first.

512
00:18:22,180 --> 00:18:25,040
歌洛莉亚 你又毁我人生
Gloria! You ruined my life again!

513
00:18:26,120 --> 00:18:27,820
这是你的戒指吗
Is this your ring?

514
00:18:28,780 --> 00:18:29,560
是的
It is!

515
00:18:31,780 --> 00:18:33,680
这是你的袜子吗
Is this your sock?

516
00:18:34,080 --> 00:18:35,260
是的
It is.

517
00:18:38,700 --> 00:18:41,020
这是... 你的牌吗
Is this...your card?

518
00:18:41,020 --> 00:18:42,100
我忘了
I don't remember!

519
00:18:42,880 --> 00:18:45,240
现在所有东西都物归原处
Now everything is where it belongs.

520
00:18:45,240 --> 00:18:49,120
除了这根蜡烛 它应该是被放在...
Except for this candle, which obviously belongs...

521
00:18:49,120 --> 00:18:52,115
钢琴上
...on the piano!

522
00:18:52,115 --> 00:18:54,140
-天啊 -什么
- Oh, my God! - What?!

523
00:18:54,140 --> 00:18:56,840
是的 感觉我就是来丢人的
You're right. It's like I want to fail!

524
00:18:57,100 --> 00:18:59,520
老爸 你别瞎说 你的表演超赞啊
Dad, stop being crazy. Your act is great!

525
00:18:59,660 --> 00:19:02,240
结尾平淡就表示这是个无聊的表演
It's a flat finish, which means it's a flat act.

526
00:19:02,360 --> 00:19:03,940
很明显是有两根蜡烛啊
It's obviously two candles.

527
00:19:04,500 --> 00:19:06,600
我是趁你们分心的时候把第二支放过去的
I put the second one over there while I was distracting you

528
00:19:06,600 --> 00:19:08,860
就是把牌射进这蠢葡萄那会儿
by throwing a card into that stupid grape.

529
00:19:10,440 --> 00:19:11,300
我们到家啦
We're home!

530
00:19:11,540 --> 00:19:12,840
我的宝贝们
My babies!

531
00:19:13,280 --> 00:19:16,280
感觉一天没见到你们了呢
I feel like I haven't seen you all day!

532
00:19:16,380 --> 00:19:18,000
你们今天玩得开心吗
Did you have fun today?

533
00:19:18,120 --> 00:19:19,500
想知道也很简单
Well, that's easy to find out.

534
00:19:19,520 --> 00:19:21,600
让我上传一下今天的婴儿镜头影片
Let me just upload this baby cam footage.

535
00:19:21,637 --> 00:19:23,280
你 你说什么
The what -- what was that? Hmm?

536
00:19:23,280 --> 00:19:25,180
他们身上其中一颗纽扣是摄像头
Oh, one of their buttons is actually a camera.

537
00:19:25,380 --> 00:19:26,580
虽然画质不怎么样 不过...
It's not the greatest quality, but...

538
00:19:26,700 --> 00:19:29,540
等等 你带我的孩子们去酒水铺了吗
Wait, you took my babies to a liquor store?!

539
00:19:29,960 --> 00:19:31,500
没有 那是...
No, it's the --

540
00:19:31,500 --> 00:19:32,820
是酒品博物馆啦
it's the wine museum.

541
00:19:33,560 --> 00:19:34,640
卢克 明明是王牌酒水铺
It's Ace Liquor, Luke.

542
00:19:34,740 --> 00:19:36,400
老娘可是打从15...
I've been going there since I was 15...

543
00:19:36,400 --> 00:19:38,480
满21岁后15分钟首次踏入那里
minutes past my 21st birthday.

544
00:19:38,600 --> 00:19:39,860
我真是不敢想象....
Well, I am horrified --

545
00:19:39,860 --> 00:19:41,360
等等 等等 我刚刚快进了
Wait, wait, wait, I just fast-forwarded,

546
00:19:41,360 --> 00:19:44,000
看到你跟一个女人在瑜伽班上说话
and it's you talking to some lady at a yoga class.

547
00:19:44,040 --> 00:19:45,140
她是杂志上的人
She's from the magazine!

548
00:19:45,180 --> 00:19:47,300
你为了生意出卖我宝宝的色相吗
You pimped out my babies for a sales pitch?

549
00:19:47,300 --> 00:19:48,520
有谁受到伤害吗
Who did it hurt?

550
00:19:50,076 --> 00:19:50,740
茵素
Poppy!

551
00:19:50,740 --> 00:19:53,400
太无耻了 我个人无法忍受...
Oh, disgusting. Personally, I can't stand --

552
00:19:53,400 --> 00:19:55,060
车管局的某个保安
Some guard at the DMV

553
00:19:55,060 --> 00:19:57,660
让我们五个月大的婴儿咬了一口他的热狗
giving our five-month-old a bite of his hot dog.

554
00:19:57,760 --> 00:19:59,240
他只是帮忙照看了一下下而已啦
He only watched them for a second.

555
00:20:00,500 --> 00:20:03,500
我本来还很高兴你们今天都愿意帮忙带孩子
I was so happy you all wanted time with the babies today,

556
00:20:03,500 --> 00:20:05,420
因为最近我有种感觉
because lately, it has felt like

557
00:20:05,420 --> 00:20:07,660
你们好像都不想跟孩子们沾上边
you didn't even want to be bothered with them.

558
00:20:07,800 --> 00:20:10,760
结果原来你们都是无利不起早
Turns out you only want to help when it can help you.

559
00:20:10,900 --> 00:20:13,120
我心里都有一点纳闷我们为什么还要住这里
Part of me wonders why we even stay here.

560
00:20:13,320 --> 00:20:15,060
因为你在这里不用交房租加饭钱吗
Because you eat and live here for free?

561
00:20:15,060 --> 00:20:15,640
我说了只有"一点"
I said "part."

562
00:20:16,100 --> 00:20:18,440
好啦 我不是要说他们做的对
Okay, I'm not saying what they did was great,

563
00:20:18,440 --> 00:20:19,840
但家人不就是这样吗
but isn't that what families do?

564
00:20:20,460 --> 00:20:21,340
互相帮助彼此
Help each other out?

565
00:20:21,340 --> 00:20:23,420
如果能够帮助到家人
And are we ever really too young

566
00:20:23,420 --> 00:20:25,420
难道有年纪太小一说吗
to come to our family's aid?

567
00:20:26,700 --> 00:20:28,600
你开什么玩笑 竟然打算说服我们
You're not seriously trying to get us

568
00:20:28,600 --> 00:20:31,340
借孩子给你拿去表演魔术
to let you use them for your magic trick, are you?

569
00:20:32,840 --> 00:20:33,800
真的是我的牌
It is my card!

570
00:20:36,360 --> 00:20:38,100
感谢各位热烈的支持
You guys have been great.

571
00:20:38,100 --> 00:20:41,200
不过是时候帮我可爱的小助手
But I should be getting my beautiful assistant here

572
00:20:41,200 --> 00:20:46,040
脱下燕尾服 换上温暖舒适的睡衣了
out of this tuxedo and into some warm jammies.

573
00:20:52,564 --> 00:20:53,582
太客气啦
You guys.

574
00:20:54,160 --> 00:20:55,620
表演成功都是你们的功劳
It's you that make it work.

575
00:20:59,780 --> 00:21:01,960
我对之前的事感到很抱歉 希望我没有太无礼
So, I'm sorry about earlier. I hope I wasn't rude.

576
00:21:02,000 --> 00:21:04,360
没事 我完全理解 你现在有空一起吃东西吗
Please. I totally get it. Are you free for a bite now?

577
00:21:04,920 --> 00:21:06,760
当然 我想我还是有点时间的
Sure. I guess I got a couple minutes.

578
00:21:07,400 --> 00:21:07,800
完美
Perfect!

579
00:21:07,800 --> 00:21:10,320
我去"直达塔帕斯"餐厅订个位子
I'll get us a table at Straight to the Tapas.

580
00:21:10,420 --> 00:21:11,480
好极了 到时候见
Great. Meet you there.

581
00:21:12,080 --> 00:21:13,680
我只是想摆脱他 我们不去
I'm just getting rid of him. We're not going.

582
00:21:13,880 --> 00:21:14,580
谢天谢地
Oh, thank God.

583
00:21:14,580 --> 00:21:15,840
他的衬衫之前提上去的时候
When his shirt rose up earlier,

584
00:21:15,840 --> 00:21:17,500
我看到一个爱探险的朵拉的纹身
I saw a Dora the Explorer tattoo.

585
00:21:17,500 --> 00:21:20,940
我可不想听到这背后的故事
And I do not want to hear the story behind that one.

586
00:21:25,440 --> 00:21:27,001
你知我知 不可外传
This stays between us.
